* Simplified Hongfa HF186F/12-HCTF, 12 V, 1 Form A relay.
* Pin order: A1 A2 13 14 (coil, normally-open contact).
* Published values: 57.6 ohm coil, <=10 milliohm contact resistance.
* Worst-case pick-up voltage is 8.4 V at 23 C; the 0.6 V release
* specification is a lower bound, not a typical switching threshold.
* The switch thresholds below approximate a voltage-controlled relay;
* coil inductance, operate/release delay, bounce and arc are not modeled.
.SUBCKT HF186F_12_HCTF A1 A2 P13 P14
RCOIL A1 A2 57.6
BCTRL CTRL 0 V=abs(V(A1,A2))
SNO P13 P14 CTRL 0 HF186F_CONTACT
.MODEL HF186F_CONTACT SW(RON=0.01 ROFF=1G VT=4.5 VH=3.9)
.ENDS HF186F_12_HCTF
